      value: -28.5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4773430625172576353, guid: d13ca1b9e06bdd946bdff8234101da0e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: "That\u2019s Correct!\n\nIdentify the universal set\n\nU = {1, 2, 3,
        4, 5, 6, 7, 8}\n\nThese are all possible chips that can be drawn.\n\nIdentify
        Event A (multiples of 4)\n\nA = {4, 8}\n\nIdentify Event B (even numbers)\n\nB
        = {2, 4, 6, 8}\n\nFind the union\n\nA \\cup B means elements that are in
        A or in B.\n\nCombine the elements of A and B without repeating numbers.\n\nA
        \\cup B = {2, 4, 6, 8}\n\nFind the intersection\n\nA \\cap B means elements
        that are in both A and B.\n\nA \\cap B = {4, 8}\n\nFind the complement of
        A\n\nA\u2032 means elements in the universal set that are not in A.\n\nA\u2032
        = {1, 2, 3, 5, 6, 7}\n\nFind the union of the complements\n\nFirst find the
        complement of B.\n\nB\u2032 = {1, 3, 5, 7}\n\nCombine the elements of A\u2032
        and B\u2032.\n\nA\u2032 \\cup B\u2032 = {1, 2, 3, 5, 6, 7}\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
